````

Alternatively, we could just make IfcSpaces invisible, which also makes them unpickable:

````javascript
const dotBIMLoader = new DotBIMLoaderPlugin(viewer, {
   objectDefaults: {
       IfcSpace: {
           visible: false
       }
   }
