 * The logged messages will look like this in the console:
 *
 * ````text
 * [LOG]   myMaterial: Everything is fine, situation normal.
 * [WARN]  myMaterial: Wait, whats that red light..
 * [ERROR] myMaterial: Aw, snap!
 * ````
 *
 * ## Destruction
